{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.poster.avif?t=1768511236\" width=600 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.webm?t=1768511236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.mp4?t=1768511236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/ee68828abebb27be08759a6ea1f6f4ec.avif?t=1768511236\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for Megabattle, a roguelike card game that combines strategic deckbuilding elements with the thrill of epic robot battles. Build a custom deck and embark on a procedurally generated journey, facing increasingly challenging trials.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/024dd0839fcf7d749ea147978a149b60.poster.avif?t=1768511236\" width=1038 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/024dd0839fcf7d749ea147978a149b60.webm?t=1768511236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/024dd0839fcf7d749ea147978a149b60.mp4?t=1768511236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Megabattle, each victory brings valuable rewards in the form of parts and upgrade cards. Utilize these resources to enhance your deck, making your robot more powerful and resilient. During battles, strategically play cards to improve your parts, attack opponents, and defend against enemy assaults.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/b9e9090e165ff8d5ce6c43342859cba6.poster.avif?t=1768511236\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/b9e9090e165ff8d5ce6c43342859cba6.webm?t=1768511236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/b9e9090e165ff8d5ce6c43342859cba6.mp4?t=1768511236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various robot classes, each with their own unique characteristics and obtainable parts. Discover new attack cards and exclusive power-ups to strengthen your arsenal and adapt to different battle strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/cb53409cedbcdfbdb096fba28ce53d64.avif?t=1768511236\" width=1148 height=644 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an immersive sci-fi/futuristic atmosphere, Megabattle transports you to a universe filled with robots, advanced technology, and thrilling action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for battle and claim victory in Megabattle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/9c5b370bed1883836f32d33302810db6.avif?t=1768511236\" width=792 height=1080 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1602030?t=1768511236","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1602030?t=1768511236","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/09d984f26fae80f222f4788153e5bca80940b7e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768511236","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/09d984f26fae80f222f4788153e5bca80940b7e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768511236","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game is set on a post apocaliptic scneario where machines made humans their slaves so they fight for their entertainment. "},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2019890,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.poster.avif?t=1768511236\" width=600 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.webm?t=1768511236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.mp4?t=1768511236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/ee6