e165ff8d5ce6c43342859cba6.mp4?t=1768511236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various robot classes, each with their own unique characteristics and obtainable parts. Discover new attack cards and exclusive power-ups to strengthen your arsenal and adapt to different battle strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/cb53409cedbcdfbdb096fba28ce53d64.avif?t=1768511236\" width=1148 height=644 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an immersive sci-fi/futuristic atmosphere, Megabattle transports you to a universe filled with robots, advanced technology, and thrilling action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for battle and claim victory in Megabattle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/9c5b370bed1883836f32d33302810db6.avif?t=1768511236\" width=792 height=1080 /></span></p>","developers":["MadCat Corp","Cavylabs","Leonardo Sousa","Gibran Bisio","Aurea Games Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/776d70e13fd59680839415abe7cc09a068460274/header.jpg?t=1768511236","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MAC OS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> OS 11+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 320M<br></li><l